sequenceDiagram
    actor Analyst
    participant UI as Open Data Explorer
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant D as Data.gov v4 API
    participant W as Import Worker
    participant P as Publisher
    participant DB as DuckDB
    participant M as MCP Query Broker
    participant N as Notebook Chat
    Analyst->>UI: Search "NTD annual service"
    UI->>API: GET /catalog/search
    API->>D: GET /search (X-Api-Key)
    D-->>API: dcat distribution, next `after` cursor
    API-->>UI: Dataset cards
    Analyst->>UI: Open dataset and preview resource
    UI->>API: POST /resources/{id}/preflight
    API-->>UI: Ready / Connector Required / Unavailable
    Analyst->>UI: Click Import (choose notebook)
    UI->>API: POST /imports
    API->>W: Queue import job
    W->>P: Safe HTTPS download (allowlist + limits)
    P-->>W: Bytes / records
    W->>DB: Stage, profile, publish immutable version
    W->>M: Register approved local read-only dataset alias
    M-->>W: Test SELECT OK
    W->>N: Attach schema + provenance to active notebook
    W-->>UI: Ready + dataset version
    Analyst->>N: Ask a question in same chat
    N->>M: Reviewed, bounded query through MCP
    M-->>N: Result + provenance
    N-->>Analyst: Chart + executed SQL + cited evidence
